	.string "Why?\n"
	.string "Why’d I lose?$"

Route14_Text_DonaldPostBattle::
	.string "Well, the winged mirages are the\n"
	.string "legendary bird POKéMON.\p"
	.string "There are three of them: ARTICUNO,\n"
	.string "ZAPDOS, and MOLTRES.$"

